@page "/aturan"
@* How the game goes, as the kids in the yard would explain it, with the court drawn from above. *@

<div class="gl-rules">
    <header class="gl-rules-head">
        <a class="gl-btn small" href=""><Glyph Name="back" Size="16" /> @L.T("Ke lapangan", "To the court")</a>
        <div class="gl-lang" role="group" aria-label="@L.T("Bahasa", "Language")">
            <button class="@(L.English ? "" : "on")" aria-pressed="@(L.English ? "false" : "true")" @onclick="() => L.Set(false)">ID</button>
            <button class="@(L.English ? "on" : "")" aria-pressed="@(L.English ? "true" : "false")" @onclick="() => L.Set(true)">EN</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <article class="gl-rules-body">
        <p class="gl-eyebrow">@L.T("Aturan main", "How to play")</p>
        <h1 class="gl-title">Galasin</h1>
        <p class="gl-lede">@L.T("Galasin, gobak sodor, atau hadang: permainan garis kapur yang dimainkan di halaman dan lapangan kampung, paling ramai menjelang 17 Agustus. Di sini dua tim berisi empat anak, dan setiap tab peramban adalah satu pemain.",
            "Galasin, gobak sodor or hadang: a chalk-line game played in kampung yards and fields, busiest in the run-up to 17 August. Here two teams of four play, and every browser tab is one player.")</p>

        <figure class="gl-court" aria-labelledby="court-cap">
            <svg viewBox="-70 -50 340 470" role="img" aria-label="@L.T("Denah lapangan", "Court plan")">
                <rect x="-60" y="-40" width="320" height="450" rx="18" class="dirt" />
                <rect x="20" y="300" width="160" height="56" class="zone" />
                <rect x="20" y="-4" width="160" height="56" class="zone" />
                <text x="100" y="350" class="zone-label">@L.T("RUMAH", "HOME")</text>
                <text x="100" y="29" class="zone-label">@L.T("UJUNG", "FAR SIDE")</text>
                <rect x="20" y="60" width="160" height="232" class="court" />
                <line x1="20" y1="176" x2="180" y2="176" class="chalk" />
                <line x1="100" y1="60" x2="100" y2="292" class="chalk" />
                <line x1="20" y1="292" x2="180" y2="292" class="guard-line" />
                <line x1="20" y1="176" x2="180" y2="176" class="guard-line" />
                <line x1="20" y1="60" x2="180" y2="60" class="guard-line" />
                <line x1="100" y1="60" x2="100" y2="292" class="sodor-line" />
                <g class="guard"><circle cx="62" cy="292" r="9" /><circle cx="128" cy="176" r="9" /><circle cx="80" cy="60" r="9" /><circle cx="100" cy="232" r="9" /></g>
                <g class="attacker"><circle cx="44" cy="318" r="8" /><circle cx="84" cy="324" r="8" /><circle cx="122" cy="319" r="8" /><circle cx="158" cy="325" r="8" /></g>
                <path d="M158 312 C 168 260, 150 210, 160 120 S 150 40, 150 20" class="trip" />
                <path d="M150 20 C 40 30, 50 120, 40 200 S 50 290, 44 316" class="trip back" />
                <text x="196" y="296" class="tag">@L.T("garis 1", "line 1")</text>
                <text x="196" y="180" class="tag">@L.T("garis 2", "line 2")</text>
                <text x="196" y="64" class="tag">@L.T("garis 3", "line 3")</text>
                <text x="106" y="252" class="tag small">sodor</text>
                <text x="-52" y="390" class="tag small">9 m × 12 m</text>
            </svg>
            <figcaption id="court-cap">@L.T("Merah berjaga: tiga anak di garis melintang, satu sodor di garis tengah. Putih menyerang dari rumah, ke ujung, lalu pulang.",
                "Red guards: three on the cross lines, one sodor on the centre line. White attacks from home to the far side and back.")</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <section>
            <h2>@L.T("Jalannya permainan", "How a match goes")</h2>
            <ol class="gl-steps">
                <li>@L.T("Satu tim menyerang, satu tim berjaga. Penjaga garis hanya boleh bergeser kiri-kanan di garisnya; sodor hanya naik-turun di garis tengah.",
                    "One team attacks, one guards. A line guard can only slide left and right along their line; the sodor only up and down the centre line.")</li>
                <li>@L.T("Penyerang berangkat dari rumah, melewati ketiga garis sampai ujung, lalu pulang lagi. Setiap anak yang bolak-balik tanpa tersentuh memberi satu poin.",
                    "Attackers set off from home, cross all three lines to the far side, then come back. Every kid who makes the round trip untouched scores a point.")</li>
                <li>@L.T("Kalau satu penyerang saja tersentuh penjaga, peluit berbunyi: ganti! Tim penjaga sekarang menyerang.",
                    "If a guard touches any attacker, the whistle goes: swap! The guarding team attacks now.")</li>
                <li>@L.T("Rumah dan ujung adalah tempat aman. Di lapangan, tangan penjaga menjangkau 0,7 m, dan 1,15 m saat menjangkau dengan Spasi.",
                    "Home and the far side are safe. On the court a guard's hand reaches 0.7 m, and 1.15 m while reaching out with Space.")</li>
                <li>@L.T("Tim yang lebih dulu mencapai target poin menang. Kalau waktu habis, yang poinnya lebih banyak menang; sama banyak berarti seri.",
                    "The first team to the target wins. If time runs out, the higher score wins; level means a draw.")</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>@L.T("Main bersama", "Playing together")</h2>
            <p>@L.T("Setiap tab yang membuka tautan lapangan yang sama masuk ke daftar pemain. Satu tab menjadi wasit: ia menjalankan aturan dan bot, lalu mengirim keadaan permainan ke tab lain dua puluh kali sedetik lewat BroadcastChannel, tanpa server. Kalau tab wasit ditutup, tab berikutnya meneruskan dari keadaan terakhir.",
                "Every tab that opens the same court link joins the sign-up sheet. One tab is the referee: it runs the rules and the bots and sends the state of play to the others twenty times a second over a BroadcastChannel, with no server. If the referee's tab closes, the next one carries on from the last state.")</p>
            <p>@L.T("Tempat yang kosong diisi bot. Penyerang bot menunggu penjaga tertarik ke satu sisi lalu menerobos di sisi lain; penjaga bot selalu sedikit terlambat.",
                "Empty places are filled by bots. A bot attacker waits for the guard to be drawn to one side and slips through on the other; a bot guard is always a beat late.")</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>@L.T("Tombol", "Controls")</h2>
            <table class="gl-keys">
                <tbody>
                    <tr><th scope="row"><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd><kbd>→</kbd> / <kbd>WASD</kbd></th><td>@L.T("lari, atau bergeser di garis", "run, or slide along your line")</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row"><kbd>@L.T("Spasi", "Space")</kbd> / <kbd>J</kbd></th><td>@L.T("penjaga: menjangkau · penyerang: lari cepat", "guard: reach out · attacker: sprint")</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">@L.T("Layar sentuh", "Touch")</th><td>@L.T("stik di kiri bawah, tombol aksi di kanan bawah", "stick bottom left, action button bottom right")</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope="row">Gamepad</th><td>@L.T("stik kiri dan tombol A", "left stick and the A button")</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </section>

        <p class="gl-credit">@L.T("Model 3D dibuat dengan Rodin dan dirangka serta dianimasikan di Blender. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil, dengan Rustzor: C# di WebAssembly lewat RustNetRuntime.",
            "3D models made with Rodin, rigged and animated in Blender. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil, with Rustzor: C# in WebAssembly on RustNetRuntime.")</p>
    </article>
</div>
